HookNext 是面向 Android 的可视化 Xposed 模块管理与运行时分析工具，无需编写 Xposed 模块即可配置 Java/Smali 方法、参数、返回值和字段 Hook。支持 Root、Shizuku、Normal 三种工作模式，以及 Hook 记录、DEX/APK/APKS 浏览、扩展 Hook、局域网 Web 管理、MCP、配置导入与分享、备份恢复、SimpleHook 迁移、Frida JavaScript 导出和应用内更新。

HookNext is a visual Android Xposed module manager and runtime analysis tool. Configure Java/Smali method, argument, return-value, and field hooks without writing an Xposed module. It supports Root, Shizuku, and Normal work modes, hook records, DEX/APK/APKS browsing, extension hooks, LAN web management, MCP access, config import and sharing, backup and restore, SimpleHook migration, Frida JavaScript export, and in-app updates.
